{"title":"What's the Use of Feeling Blue","artist":"Steven Universe","sourceId":"reference:zcGUdzb1vTNA9EUv1DxJ","sourceHash":"88cd8884ae4c0381d63739ba570748a9846fdb393788f0e572e2427112b69d3f","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.09,"end":2.97,"text":"Aah-ha-ha, aah-ha-ha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":2.97,"end":5.970000000000001,"text":"Aah-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":6.18,"end":8.48,"text":"Aah-ha-ha, aah-ha-ha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":8.48,"end":11.48,"text":"Aah-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":14.7,"end":17.7,"text":"Why would you want to be here?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":17.93,"end":20.93,"text":"What do you ever see here?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":21.97,"end":24.96,"text":"That doesn't make you feel worse than you do?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":24.96,"end":27.96,"text":"And tell me, what's the use of feeling, Blue?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":29.86,"end":32.86,"text":"Why would you want to employ her subjects that destroyed her?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":37.31,"end":39.85,"text":"Why keep up her silly zoo?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":39.85,"end":42.85,"text":"Oh, tell me, what's the use of feeling, Blue?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":44.92,"end":47.92,"text":"An army has a use, they can go and fight a war","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":48.67,"end":51.67,"text":"A sapphire has a use, she can tell you what it's for","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":52.51,"end":55.51,"text":"An agate terrifies, a lapis terraforms!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":55.95,"end":58.28,"text":"Where's their Diamond when they need them, Blue?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":58.28,"end":60.73,"text":"You've got to be a leader, Blue!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":60.73,"end":63.73,"text":"Yes, of course we still love her","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":63.79,"end":66.78999999999999,"text":"And we're always thinking of her","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":67.75,"end":70.75,"text":"But now there's nothing we can do, so tell me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":71.66,"end":73.72,"text":"What's the use of feeling?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":73.72,"end":75.38,"text":"What's the use of feeling?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":75.38,"end":78.38,"text":"What's the use of feeling, Blue?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":79.38,"end":82.38,"text":"Oh, how can you stand to be here with it all? (Here with it all)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":86.99,"end":89.99,"text":"Drowning in all this regret","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":90.81,"end":93.6,"text":"Wouldn't you rather forget her?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":93.6,"end":96.6,"text":"Oh, won't it be grand to get rid of it all? (Rid of it all)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":102.12,"end":105.12,"text":"Let's make a plan and attack","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":105.89,"end":108.89,"text":"Start looking forward and stop looking back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":109.46000000000001,"end":112.46000000000001,"text":"Oh, yes, of course we still love her","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":113.22,"end":116.22,"text":"And we're always thinking of her","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":117.33,"end":120.33,"text":"Don't you know I miss her, too?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":121.55,"end":124.3,"text":"But, tell me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":124.3,"end":127.11,"text":"What's the use of feeling?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":127.11,"end":129.45,"text":"What's the use of feeling?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":129.45,"end":130.91,"text":"What's the use of feeling?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":130.91,"end":133.91,"text":"Mmm-hmm-hmm, mmm-hmm-hmm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":135.14,"end":138.14,"text":"Mmm-hmm-hmm-hmm-hmm-hmm-hmm-hmm-mmm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}